      {"page": 2, "text": "Overview", "x": 72, "top": 72.05, "width": 63.68, "height": 19.63, "baseline": 87.36},
      {"page": 2, "text": "The first paragraph after a heading takes the First Paragraph style. Later paragraphs take Body Text.", "x": 72, "top": 99.17, "width": 445.82, "height": 13.48, "baseline": 109.68},
      {"page": 2, "text": "Inline formatting covers bold, italic, both, strikethrough, inline", "x": 72, "top": 113.37, "width": 286.99, "height": 13.68, "baseline": 124.08},
      {"page": 2, "text": "superscripts, underline, highlight and raw HTML spans.", "x": 72, "top": 128.21, "width": 244.36, "height": 13.48, "baseline": 138.72},
      {"page": 2, "text": "code, H2O subscripts, x2", "x": 364.44, "top": 113.37, "width": 105.86, "height": 13.68, "baseline": 124.08, "baselines": [120, 124.08, 125.04]},
      {"page": 2, "text": "That line ended with a hard break.", "x": 72, "top": 142.61, "width": 153.53, "height": 13.48, "baseline": 153.12},
      {"page": 2, "text": "Links can be external (example.com), automatic (https://www.rust-lang.org), e-mail", "x": 72, "top": 163.01, "width": 374.06, "height": 13.48, "baseline": 173.52},
